  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rj-zewi-gumeCfhc-htlzc0Tr2WNKuhk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rj-zewi-gumeCfhc-htlzc0Tr2WNKuhk/view?usp=sharing</a>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>오소마츠상에서 병뚜껑을 열기위해 6형제가 고군분투하는 내용이 나옵니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p>병뚜껑을 여는 비밀이 나오는 자막을 네모칸으로 가려놓은 뒤, 수업 시작전에 보여주고&#160;</p><p>어떻게해야 병뚜껑을 열 수 있을지 학생들에게 물어볼 예정입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>정답은 병뚜껑을 데워 열팽창을 이용하는것입니다 ^^ (뜨거운 물에 담그거나, 불로 가열하거나)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>최대한 짧게 수정했습니다.&#160;</p><p>필요하신분 드라이브로 받아가세요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>＊２０２５。０８。２７ 드라이브 링크 수정했습니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p>유튜브 링크 첨부합니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/b4rk0B5fAXU\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/b4rk0B5fAXU</a>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfoe0snmkkmjpalaxez3qdy8@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvfoe0snmkkmjpalaxez3qdy8%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33163130628%26signature%3DoCcdvi%252BMIzJ4Fi4hCrn4BFzrBdA%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfoe0snmkkmjpalaxez3qdy8?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Zm9lMHNubWtrbWpwYWxheGV6M3FkeTgiLCJ0aWQiOiI0ZjYzMWQwNy1mMDI4LTRjYWUtOWFjMC00ZjcxY2ZhOTAwOWUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI1OTF9.FahZ86ICSVOcASdGZagmQnwN2h0gJ-2B8FFZ8WNssifRarnfQ8jJoM83Tg2eUE1Cu-tU_R5zpfm5Sjwtn329vA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" al